OL,3,GNEWSAWorker dies after incident at
OL,4,Ashopping centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 40s has died after an
OL,7,Fincident at Brent Cross Shopping Centre
OL,8,Fin north-west London.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,Fcentre in Prince Charles Drive, Hendon,
OL,12,Fshortly after 05:00 GMT on Wednesday.
OL,13,FThe man, who had been carrying out work
OL,14,Fat the shopping centre, was taken to
OL,15,Fhospital but died the following day,
OL,16,Fthe Metropolitan Police said.
OL,18,FA spokesperson for the shopping centre
OL,19,Fsaid they were "deeply saddened by the
OL,20,Fpassing of a contractor who was
OL,21,Fundertaking overnight works earlier
OL,22,Fthis week".
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
